<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n下面是一种可能的做法。设<MATH_0013>。\n考虑函子（functors）之间的变换（transformation）<MATH_0014>，它将三元组（triple）<MATH_0015>（在<MATH_0016>上）送到三元组（triple）<MATH_0017>。引理<REF_0003>的结论之一是，变换（transformation）<MATH_0018>是单射（injective）的！\n对于拟紧（quasi-compact）概形（scheme）<MATH_0019>，我们定义\n<MATH_0020>\n其中的过渡映射（transition maps）如上所述。这显然定义了一个反变函子（contravariant functor）。它定义在一个范畴（category）上，该范畴由拟紧（quasi-compact）概形（schemes）构成。它取值于集合（sets）。对于一般的概形（scheme）<MATH_0021>，我们定义\n<MATHSEG_0001> 拟紧开集（quasi-compact open）<MATHSEG_0002>\n换言之，元素（element）<MATH_0022>属于<MATH_0023>，它对应于一个相容系（compatible system），该系由对元素（elements）<MATH_0024>的选择组成，其中<MATH_0025>遍历<MATH_0026>的所有拟紧（quasi-compact）开集（opens）。\n我们略去拉回（pullback）映射（map）<MATH_0027>的定义，它对应于态射（morphism）<MATH_0028>，后者在概形（schemes）之间。\n这样，我们就定义了所需的函子（functor）\n<MATH_0029>\n\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:421de06b98bd09619ef3a9380c810033ec9f12990685e5a46b5df46f466afd2a", "unit_id": "tag:01N4:prose-0004", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "环带有分次结构。", "source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"context": "承载三元组的开子概形。", "source_term": "open subscheme", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"context": "原文在开子概形之后再次使用概形一词。", "source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "开子概形上的三元组。", "source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组"}, {"context": "限制到同一个开集上的两个三元组。", "source_term": "triples", "target_term": "三元组"}, {"context": "把三元组限制到开集上。", "source_term": "restricted", "target_term": "限制"}, {"context": "用来限制三元组的开集。", "source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"context": "两个限制后的三元组之间的关系。", "source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"context": "限制所用的开集与另一集合之间的包含关系。", "source_term": "subset", "target_term": "子集"}, {"context": "与等价类大致对应的态射。", "source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "构成等价类的三元组。", "source_term": "triples", "target_term": "三元组"}, {"context": "按照三元组之间的等价关系得到的类。", "source_term": "equivalence classes", "target_term": "等价类"}, {"context": "适用单个三元组时涉及的拟紧性。", "source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"context": "单个可能满足要求的三元组。", "source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组"}, {"context": "需要定义的函子。", "source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"context": "变换所联系的两个函子。", "source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"context": "函子之间的变换。", "source_term": "transformation", "target_term": "变换"}, {"context": "函子之间的变换所接受的三元组。", "source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组"}, {"context": "函子之间的变换所给出的三元组。", "source_term": "triple", "target_term": "三元组"}, {"context": "引理断言为单射的变换。", "source_term": "transformation", "target_term": "变换"}, {"context": "描述所述变换的单射性。", "source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射"}, {"context": "限定此处用于定义的概形。", "source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"context": "此处用来定义函子的拟紧概形。", "source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "定义中所用的过渡映射。", "source_term": "transition maps", "target_term": "过渡映射"}, {"context": "定义所得的函子具有反变性。", "source_term": "contravariant functor", "target_term": "反变函子"}, {"context": "该函子定义在由拟紧概形构成的范畴上。", "source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "限定反变函子所定义于的范畴中的概形。", "source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"context": "构成该范畴的概形。", "source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "反变函子的取值为集合。", "source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"context": "一般情形中用来定义函子的概形。", "source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "数学文字中对开集所作的拟紧性限定。", "source_term": "quasi-compact open", "target_term": "拟紧开集"}, {"context": "与一个相容系对应的元素。", "source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"context": "由对各元素的相容选择构成的系。", "source_term": "compatible system", "target_term": "相容系"}, {"context": "相容系所选取的元素。", "source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素"}, {"context": "限定所遍历的开集。", "source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"context": "由指标遍历的开集。", "source_term": "opens", "target_term": "开集"}, {"context": "由概形态射诱导的拉回。", "source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"context": "所略去定义的拉回映射。", "source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"context": "与所述拉回映射对应的态射